    "section": "Event Companion",
    "summary": "For Singles, start with random opponents in round one. In later rounds, the recommended order follows. First, group by record across wins, losses and draws. Two players at 3–1 can meet under this criterion. Second, factor in the sequence of wins and losses. Third, use random pairings within the same bracket.",
